# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DEFAULT-DENY whitelist.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC and the research tree was merged into it while a
# patent application on the compile->INT8->edge pipeline is being prepared.
# A stray `git add -A` must therefore not be able to publish anything new.
# Everything is ignored unless explicitly re-included below, and the allowed
# list is exactly the files that were already public before the merge.
#
# To publish something new, add an explicit `!` line for it — deliberately.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/app.py

!/models/
models/*
!models/__init__.py
!models/quantum_layers.py
!models/vqc_deploy.py

!/yolo26q/
yolo26q/*
!yolo26q/__init__.py
!yolo26q/bottleneck_vqc.py
!yolo26q/register.py

!/weights/
weights/*
!weights/best.onnx
!weights/best.pt
!weights/best_int8_pctA.onnx

!/samples/
samples/**/__pycache__/

# never, under any circumstance
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.venv/
